<title>USA: BancAmerica wins Industry, Calif., $143 mln deal.</title>
<headline>BancAmerica wins Industry, Calif., $143 mln deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said Tuesday it won Industry Urban Development Agency, Calif.'s $143 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The scale follows:  </p>
<p>AMT: 143,270,000    DATE: 02/11/97	NYC Time: 1400</p>
<p>CUSIP: 456567</p>
<p>ISSUER: Industry Urban-Development Agency ST: CA</p>
<p>ISSUE: 1997 Tax Allocation Refunding, See Notes</p>
<p>TAX STAT: Exempt-REV</p>
<p>M/SP/F: Baa1/A-/NA</p>
